msgctxt "80"
msgid ""
"(Yumi... There's so much I wish I had gotten the chance to\r\n"
"say to you. I'm sure the same goes for Haruka. So, we'll be\r\n"
"back to visit again. I promise.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"(Yumi... I still think back to the time me, you, and Nishiki\r\n"
"spent at Sunflower. We sure had some fun, huh?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"(Even after Nishiki and I joined up with the Dojima Family,\r\n"
"we never stopped spending time with you. Serena, the bar\r\n"
"where you worked, ended up our favorite hangout spot.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"(The three of us were happy then. Looking back on it now,\r\n"
"it almost feels like a dream.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"(Then on that fateful day... Sohei Dojima kidnapped you,\r\n"
"and you had to watch while Nishiki murdered him. The shock\r\n"
"of it all caused you to lose your memory.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"(Before you had regained it, though, you met a Diet member\r\n"
"named Kyohei Jingu and conceived a child with him... Haruka.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"(Once you recovered your memory and learned of Jingu's plan,\r\n"
"you left Haruka at Sunflower and began working with Chairman\r\n"
"Sera and Kazama-san to stop him.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"(Yumi... There's so much I wish I had gotten the chance to\r\n"
"say to you. I'm sure the same goes for Haruka. So, we'll be\r\n"
"back to visit again. I promise.)"
msgstr ""

